---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China';
const description = 'Common payment failure reasons for foreign travelers in China and step-by-step troubleshooting when your QR code payment won\'t go through.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/en/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 Payment</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Don't panic — most payment failures are easy to fix.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 4 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Payment failures are common for foreign users.</strong> Most are caused by daily limits, bank fraud blocks, or network issues. Try switching to cash, using a different app, or connecting to WiFi. If nothing works, wait a few hours and try again.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        It's going to happen at some point. You're at a shop, you scan the QR code, the app spins for a moment, and then — error. Payment failed.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Don't panic. Payment failures in China are common for foreign users, and most of the time it's a simple fix.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔍</span> Why It Happened
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">1. You hit the daily limit</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Both Alipay and WeChat Pay have limits on how much you can spend. If you've been shopping, you might have hit the ceiling.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Wait until the next day — daily limits reset.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">2. Your bank blocked the transaction</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Your bank sees a charge coming from China and thinks it's fraud.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Check your notifications — your bank usually sends an SMS asking if it's you. Approve it and try again. Notify your bank before you travel to avoid this.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">3. Network issue</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Your VPN might have disconnected, or the merchant's internet is slow.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Check your VPN, toggle airplane mode on/off, or ask the merchant if they can try again.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">4. Merchant doesn't accept international cards</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Some smaller vendors have payment accounts that only work with Chinese bank cards.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong> Use cash, or ask if they accept WeChat Pay (sometimes that works when Alipay doesn't).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> Quick Troubleshooting Checklist
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>Switch to the other app</strong> — If Alipay fails, try WeChat Pay (or vice versa)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>Use cash</strong> — Always carry ¥500–1000 in small bills as backup</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>Connect to WiFi</strong> — Ask the merchant for their WiFi; sometimes cellular data is the issue</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>Restart the app</strong> — Close and reopen Alipay or WeChat</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>Wait and retry</strong> — Some issues resolve themselves after a few minutes</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

                <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 Next Reads</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/en/payment/payment-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              How to Pay in China
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/en/payment/setup-alipay/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              How to Set Up Alipay
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

        <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="not-prose mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-lg">📚</span> Sources
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-brand-500 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">Alipay - Consumers Center</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-300 ml-auto shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </li>        <li>
          <a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 no-underline">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-brand-500 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
            <span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-brand-700">WeChat - Help Center</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-300 ml-auto shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "HowTo", "name": "What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China", "step": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Switch to the other app", "text": "1 Switch to the other app — If Alipay fails, try WeChat Pay (or vice versa)"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Use cash", "text": "2 Use cash — Always carry ¥500–1000 in small bills as backup"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Connect to WiFi", "text": "3 Connect to WiFi — Ask the merchant for their WiFi; sometimes cellular data is the issue"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Restart the app", "text": "4 Restart the app — Close and reopen Alipay or WeChat"}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Wait and retry", "text": "5 Wait and retry — Some issues resolve themselves after a few minutes"}]}</script>
</Layout>